---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPortrait from '../assets/about/mw-portrait.png';
---

<section id="about" class="about section-block" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about__grid">
			<div class="about__content">
				<div class="heading-block">
					<p class="text-accent section-label">Beyond the browser</p>
					<h2 id="about-heading">Everyone deserves quality, and I want to bring it to them.</h2>
					<div class="about__body content-copy">
						<p>
							I've always loved the little things. Tweaking a margin until it feels
							right, getting a color just a little closer, finding the image that
							actually belongs. Somewhere along the way, it found its way into
							marketing, design, and the web, and I never really left.
						</p>
						<p>
							Whether I'm working with a million-dollar brand or a mom-and-pop shop, I
							approach the work the same way: with care, curiosity, and a little bit of
							pride. I grew up in a small town in upstate New York, where doing good
							work matters and quality can be the thing that sets one business apart
							from another. I like to think where I come from, it was just how things
							were done.
						</p>
						<p>
							When I'm not behind a screen, I like getting as far away from one as
							possible. Camping, fishing, sitting around a fire, or keeping up with the
							NBA are some of my favorite ways to unplug. There's something about being
							outside, getting your hands dirty, and slowing down that tends to clear
							my head. I usually come back with a little more perspective and sometimes
							a better idea.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about__media">
				<Image
					class="about__portrait"
					src={aboutPortrait}
					alt="Matthew smiling in a cap sitting in a folding chair holding a drink beside a glowing campfire in a green park, creating a relaxed mood."
					widths={[320, 448, 640, 832]}
					sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 26rem, min(100vw - 2.5rem, 26rem)"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about__grid {
		--about-media-width: clamp(18rem, 30vw, 26rem);

		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-lg);
	}

	.about__body {
		max-width: 68ch;
	}

	.about__media {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.about__portrait {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: var(--home-rail);
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background-color: var(--color-surface-muted);
	}

	@media (min-width: 64rem) {
		.about__grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) var(--about-media-width);
			gap: var(--space-xl);
			align-items: stretch;
		}

		/* The photo fills the full height of the copy block, so both sit on the same
		   top and bottom edges. */
		.about__media {
			position: relative;
		}

		.about__portrait {
			position: absolute;
			inset: 0;
			height: 100%;
			max-width: none;
			aspect-ratio: auto;
		}
	}
</style>
